WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:16.409
Zann urged the prisoners.

2
00:00:16.429 --> 00:00:19.029
"We need to get out of here fast!"

3
00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:24.871
He had opened all the cells, and now Boz and Teplo were helping him guide the released prisoners

4
00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:26.052
up the narrow stairway.

5
00:00:26.816 --> 00:00:30.979
When everyone was at the top of the stairs and out of the Dousing spell's range, some of

6
00:00:31.019 --> 00:00:33.881
the stronger Reds began zapping the weaker Reds to safety.

7
00:00:34.521 --> 00:00:35.902
The king approached Zann.

8
00:00:35.922 --> 00:00:39.245
"Well done, young man," said the king.

9
00:00:39.265 --> 00:00:40.766
"You're a hero.

10
00:00:41.266 --> 00:00:47.650
I'm going to recommend that you Just then Zann heard a faint sound—it sounded like a heartbeat.

11
00:00:48.371 --> 00:00:50.472
He tried to ignore it, but it was impossible.

12
00:00:51.153 --> 00:00:55.796
It was as if the sound wouldn't let him think about anything else—it was forcing him to listen.

13
00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.677
"Your Majesty," said Zann, interrupting the king.

14
00:00:59.697 --> 00:01:02.578
"I'm sorry, but do you hear that sound?"

15
00:01:03.298 --> 00:01:04.698
The king gave Zann a funny look.

16
00:01:05.178 --> 00:01:06.939
"What sound are you talking about?"

17
00:01:06.959 --> 00:01:10.320
"It sounds like a heartbeat," said Zann.

18
00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.101
The king listened but didn't seem to hear it.

19
00:01:13.761 --> 00:01:15.201
Boz and Teplo hurried over to them.

20
00:01:15.221 --> 00:01:17.762
"Did you say you hear a heartbeat?"

21
00:01:18.042 --> 00:01:19.503
Teplo asked, looking anxious.

22
00:01:19.523 --> 00:01:21.803
"It's probably a Guiding spell!

23
00:01:22.503 --> 00:01:24.384
You said Fala is here in the palace, yes?"

24
00:01:25.192 --> 00:01:27.473
Zann had no idea what Teplo was talking about.

25
00:01:27.493 --> 00:01:29.813
"What's a Guiding spell?"

26
00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:30.534
he asked.

27
00:01:30.554 --> 00:01:34.355
"It's a very old-fashioned spell," Teplo explained.

28
00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:36.515
"I taught Fala how to do it.

29
00:01:37.155 --> 00:01:42.037
Hardly anybody uses a Guiding spell these days—ever since message moths were discovered.

30
00:01:42.957 --> 00:01:49.639
But you never know when you might find yourself in a precarious situation without one of those moths."

31
00:01:50.259 --> 00:01:52.500
"You and your strange old tricks!"

32
00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:53.520
Boz laughed.

33
00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.521
"Focus on the sound, Zann," Teplo said.

34
00:01:56.541 --> 00:02:00.704
"Fala is directing it to you, so you're the only one who can hear it.

35
00:02:01.404 --> 00:02:04.726
The closer you get to Fala, the louder the sound will get."

36
00:02:05.846 --> 00:02:07.247
Zann focused on the heartbeat.

37
00:02:07.907 --> 00:02:11.889
He noticed that he could hear it slightly better if he turned toward the long hallway.

38
00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:15.611
He took a step in that direction and the sound became much more distinct.

39
00:02:15.631 --> 00:02:20.434
"I think we're supposed to go this way," said Zann, pointing down the hallway.

40
00:02:20.454 --> 00:02:23.976
"That leads to the ballroom," said the king.

41
00:02:25.016 --> 00:02:25.796
"To the ballroom!"

42
00:02:26.136 --> 00:02:26.917
Teplo commanded.

43
00:02:27.637 --> 00:02:31.078
Zann headed along the hallway, followed by all the freed Reds.

44
00:02:31.878 --> 00:02:35.719
With each step he took, he could hear the sound become louder and clearer.

45
00:02:36.559 --> 00:02:39.340
Soon they rounded a corner and arrived in the ballroom.

46
00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:44.561
Fala was there, along with Perda, Gliss, Darb, and all the rebels.

47
00:02:45.402 --> 00:02:47.702
As soon as Zann saw Fala, the sound stopped.

48
00:02:48.682 --> 00:02:51.623
The rebels gasped when they saw the freed Reds come into the room.

49
00:02:51.643 --> 00:02:53.484
"Mom! Dad!"

50
00:02:53.764 --> 00:02:56.433
Gliss cried, flinging herself into her parents' arms.

51
00:02:56.453 --> 00:02:58.694
"Gliss! You're safe!"

52
00:02:59.154 --> 00:03:00.335
Her mother hugged her tightly.

53
00:03:00.355 --> 00:03:03.676
"We were terribly worried about you," her father added.

54
00:03:03.696 --> 00:03:05.677
"And so was your uncle Gar."

55
00:03:05.697 --> 00:03:10.360
"I'm glad you're okay, Gliss," said Uncle Gar, who had just walked over.

56
00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.982
Meanwhile Perda and Darb rushed over to Zann, along with Zing.

57
00:03:15.742 --> 00:03:16.402
"You did it!

58
00:03:16.723 --> 00:03:18.063
You found the dungeon!"

59
00:03:18.403 --> 00:03:19.164
Perda exclaimed.

60
00:03:19.916 --> 00:03:24.520
Darb grinned and clapped Zann on the back while Zing flew in circles overhead, whistling.

61
00:03:25.321 --> 00:03:28.323
Zann was happy to see his friends, but he also felt nervous.

62
00:03:29.144 --> 00:03:30.565
Morb could show up at any moment.

63
00:03:31.506 --> 00:03:33.347
Nearby Fala was speaking with the king.

64
00:03:33.367 --> 00:03:38.132
"Your Majesty, Morb left the palace a short time ago," Fala told him.

65
00:03:38.152 --> 00:03:42.535
"But I'm not sure why, and I don't know when he'll return."

66
00:03:43.336 --> 00:03:44.057
The king nodded.

67
00:03:44.437 --> 00:03:47.940
Still weakened from the leech treatments, he spoke quietly to the crowd.

68
00:03:48.624 --> 00:03:55.328
"Citizens of Magica, I hereby declare Morb to be an enemy of our world," said the king.

69
00:03:55.348 --> 00:04:00.751
"Not since the Dark Times has Magica faced such a serious threat.

70
00:04:01.751 --> 00:04:05.373
Morb is to be arrested immediately when he returns."

71
00:04:06.273 --> 00:04:11.736
"Your Majesty, that might not be as easy as it sounds," said Boz.

72
00:04:12.437 --> 00:04:15.899
"Morb has become quite powerful in the last few days."

73
00:04:16.859 --> 00:04:22.299
"Even with all the Reds, we still might not be able to apprehend him," Vig added.

74
00:04:22.319 --> 00:04:24.921
"Then what are we going to do?"

75
00:04:25.381 --> 00:04:25.981
asked the queen.

76
00:04:26.001 --> 00:04:30.204
"We need a plan to ambush Morb," someone said.

77
00:04:30.945 --> 00:04:33.166
Growing impatient, Zann looked for his friends.

78
00:04:33.927 --> 00:04:36.769
Darb and Perda had gone over to join Gliss and her parents.

79
00:04:37.669 --> 00:04:40.411
Zing was nearby, nosing at a beetle on the floor.

80
00:04:41.172 --> 00:04:46.656
The far end of the ballroom opened out to the courtyard where Zann had seen Morb's magic-sucking machine.

81
00:04:47.728 --> 00:04:52.872
Zann wandered over, and he could see the machine crouched out there like a dark, terrible monster.

82
00:04:53.673 --> 00:04:56.735
Something new had been added to it since Zann had seen it yesterday.

83
00:04:57.475 --> 00:05:00.578
Perched at the very top was a strange-looking object.

84
00:05:01.478 --> 00:05:02.459
"What is that?"

85
00:05:02.859 --> 00:05:03.820
he murmured to himself.

86
00:05:04.641 --> 00:05:06.402
Zann stepped outside for a better look.

87
00:05:07.082 --> 00:05:10.085
When he got closer, he could see the new item more clearly.

88
00:05:11.045 --> 00:05:14.368
It was the jawbone from some kind of animal, perhaps a dragon.

89
00:05:15.144 --> 00:05:17.685
It was lined with large, razor-sharp teeth.

90
00:05:18.506 --> 00:05:24.169
Zann stood in front of the machine, staring at the pythons writhing in a tube filled with silvery

91
00:05:24.269 --> 00:05:27.651
liquid. Below that was a basin of dark water.

92
00:05:28.471 --> 00:05:31.933
Floating in the water was a multicolored, spongelike creature.

93
00:05:32.754 --> 00:05:34.414
Zann leaned in for a closer look.

94
00:05:35.175 --> 00:05:36.536
He'd never seen anything like it.

95
00:05:37.316 --> 00:05:39.297
Suddenly he heard a soft thump.

96
00:05:40.718 --> 00:05:44.360
Zann looked up to see that one of the pythons was looking right at him.

97
00:05:45.232 --> 00:05:47.714
Startled, Zann leaped backward with a gasp.

98
00:05:48.515 --> 00:05:53.980
Walking around to the other side of the machine, Zann examined the complicated network of bones and wire.

99
00:05:54.801 --> 00:05:56.963
How had Morb ever built such a thing?

100
00:05:57.663 --> 00:06:00.606
Just then Zann heard footsteps entering the courtyard.

101
00:06:01.327 --> 00:06:04.650
He quickly ducked behind a large plant and held his breath.

102
00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:11.596
His heart pounding, Zann peeked between the leaves and saw Morb, flanked by several ugly trolls.
